    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDistinguished Coastal Residence in an Exclusive Gated Setting.\nSet within a private, secure gated development along the prestigious Howth Road, this exceptional four-bedroom semi-detached family home combines generous proportions, elegant interiors, and a superb coastal location. Extending to approximately 247 sq.m (2,658 sq.ft.), the property is presented in excellent condition throughout and is further enhanced by a magnificent south-west facing rear garden, offering exceptional privacy and all-day sunshine.\nArranged over three spacious levels, the accommodation has been thoughtfully designed to cater for modern family living. A welcoming entrance hall leads to a guest WC, a comfortable family room, and an impressive interconnecting living room, creating a wonderful balance of formal and informal living space. To the rear, the generously proportioned kitchen/dining room forms the heart of the home, while both the kitchen and living room open into a large wraparound conservatory overlooking the beautifully maintained gardens. A separate utility room adds further practicality.\nThe first floor comprises three large double bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en-suite, together with a stylish family shower room. The top floor provides a superb fourth double bedroom suite with its own en-suite bathroom, offering ideal accommodation for guests, older children, or a luxurious main bedroom retreat.\nOutside, the property enjoys a private driveway with ample car parking and a wonderfully secluded rear garden benefiting from a highly sought-after south-westerly aspect. The mature landscaped grounds surrounding the development create an attractive and peaceful environment, while modern comforts include gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows, alarm system, and intercom access.\nThe location is simply outstanding. Positioned between the villages of Howth and Sutton, residents enjoy the very best of coastal living, with beaches, scenic cliff and harbour walks, cafés, restaurants, and a wealth of leisure amenities all within easy reach. Excellent transport links include nearby bus routes and both Howth and Sutton DART stations, while a selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools serve the area. Golf, sailing, rugby, tennis, and a range of sports clubs are all close by, together with the leisure facilities at Sutton Cross including a gym, swimming pool, and spa.\nRarely does a home of this calibre, size, and setting come to the market. Offering spacious family accommodation within a prestigious gated coastal community, it presents a unique opportunity to acquire an exceptional home in one of North Dublin's most desirable residential locations."
      },
      {
