        "Content": "\nHall - \nSemi-solid timber floor, coving, recess lights, alarm control panel, phone point, under stairs storage, intercom.\n\nWC - 1.4m x 1.5m\nWHB with cabinet, WC, tiled floor, heated towel rail radiator, recess lights, extractor fan.\n\nFamily Room - 3.5m x 3.9m\nSemi-solid timber floor, coving, recess lights, built-in shelving display, box bay window, French doors through to ..\n\nLiving Room - 6.76m x 4.8m\nSemi-solid timber floor, coal effect gas fire, built-in shelving display, coving, recess lights, French doors out to conservatory, French doors through to...\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.4m x 6.8m\nFitted kitchen, integrated double oven, microwave, 5 ring gas hob, extractor fan, integrated dish washer and fridge / freezer, island, with stone style counter tops, tiled floor, recess lights, French doors out to conservatory.\n\nUtility Room - 2.4m x 1.5m\nFitted cabinets with counter tops, sink, plumbed for washing machine, space for condenser dryer, tiled floor, recess lights.\n\nConservatory - 10.4m x 3.1m\nWrap around conservatory, tiled floor, stove, 2 x French doors out to rear garden.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - \nHot press, recess lights, build in desk with shelving display.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.4m x 4.8m\nFitted wardrobes, recess lights, tv point, walk-through wardrobes, recess lights.\n\nEnsuite - 2.1m x 1.8m\nWHB with cabinet, WC, corner shower, fully tiled, heated towel rail, recess lights, extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.6m x 4.0m\nFitted wardrobes, recess lights, French doors out to balcony with sea views.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.8m x 4.5m\nFitted wardrobes.\n\nShower Room - 3.5m x 3.3m\nWHB with cabinet, WC, walk-in shower, heated towel rail radiator, tiled floor, part tiled walls, wood paneling, recess lights, extractor fan, wall lights.\n\nSecond Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 0.9m x 4.7m\nSide window, recess lights.\n\nBedroom 4 - 5.5m x 3.9m\nFitted wardrobes, dormer box bay window, skylight, acces to eaves storage.\n\nEnsuite - 2.5m x 1.6m\nWHB with cabinet, WC, bath with rain shower, fully tiled, heated towel rail, velux window.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront Garden - \nPrivate cobble-lock driveway with off street parking for 2 cars, gated side entrance plus an additional designated parking space, also visitor parking spaces.\n\nRear Garden - \nSouth west facing, not overlooked, walled, lawn, landscaped flower beds, steel shed, garden lighting, outdoor tap.\n\n"
